{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04321","headline":"弃妾篇 · 乔知之","name":"弃妾篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾本丛台右，君在鴈门陲。\n悠悠淇水曲，彩燕入桑枝。\n不因媒结好，本以容相知。\n容谢君应去，情移会有离。\n还君结缕带，归妾识成诗。\n此物虽轻贱，不用使人嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔知之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}